      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Only two nodes call the model, and both are handed evidence that\nwas already gathered. The model narrates; it never decides what\nto probe, so the same question yields the same investigation.",
      "originalText": "Only two nodes call the model, and both are handed evidence that\nwas already gathered. The model narrates; it never decides what\nto probe, so the same question yields the same investigation.",
